# The native projects are generated, not written. `app.config.ts` is the only
# description of them that exists, and `npx expo prebuild` (which EAS Build runs
# for us) turns it into these two directories on demand. Committing them would
# create a second, stale answer to every question app.config.ts already answers
# — the AndroidManifest would keep whatever permissions it was generated with
# long after the config stopped asking for them.
/android
/ios

# @generated expo-cli sync-2b81b286409207a5da26e14c78851eb30d8ccbdb
